flowchart LR
    learner[Administrator] --> cli[Azure CLI]
    cli --> graph[Microsoft Graph v1.0]
    graph --> userA[Cloud user A<br/>group member]
    graph --> userB[Cloud user B<br/>group owner]
    graph --> group[Security group]
    userA -->|memberOf| group
    userB -->|owns| group
    cli --> state[Local run.json<br/>object IDs only]
    state --> validate[Read-only validation]
    validate --> graph

    classDef identity fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#0078d4,color:#10253f;
    classDef local fill:#f4f4f4,stroke:#666,color:#222;
    class userA,userB,group,graph identity;
    class state,validate local;
